<?php /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $rows */ /** @var int $total */ /** @var int $page */ /** @var int $perPage */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $filters */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $qs */ /** @var bool $canManage */ use Vertex\Core\View;
$lab = ['draft' => 'Draft', 'sent' => 'Sent', 'partially_signed' => 'Partly signed', 'executed' => 'Executed', 'cancelled' => 'Cancelled', 'expired' => 'Expired']; ?>
<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Documents</p><h1>Agreements</h1></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/agreement-templates">Templates</a><?php if ($canManage) : ?><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/agreements/new">New agreement</a><?php endif; ?></div></div>
<form method="get" action="/agreements" class="toolbar" role="search"><div class="field"><label for="q">Search</label><input id="q" name="q" type="search" maxlength="100" value="<?= e($filters['q']) ?>"></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="st">Status</label><select id="st" name="status"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach ($lab as $k => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($k) ?>"<?= $filters['status'] === $k ? ' selected' : '' ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="field"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Filter</button></div></form>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Agreement</th><th>Client</th><th>Method</th><th>Status</th><th>Expires</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach ($rows as $r) : ?><tr><td><a href="/agreements/<?= e($r['public_id']) ?>"><strong><?= e($r['reference']) ?></strong></a><br><span class="muted"><?= e($r['title']) ?></span></td><td><?= e($r['client_name']) ?></td><td><?= $r['mode'] === 'online' ? 'Online' : 'Paper' ?></td><td><?= e($lab[$r['status']] ?? $r['status']) ?></td><td><?= $r['expires_on'] ? e(local_date($r['expires_on'])) : '-' ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
<?php if ($rows === []) : ?><tr><td colspan="5" class="muted">No agreements yet.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div>
<?= View::partial('pagination', ['page' => $page, 'perPage' => $perPage, 'total' => $total, 'filters' => $qs]) ?>
